## 1. Purpose

This policy lists sectors the bank will not originate into, and sectors that need ESG sign-off.

## 2. Scope

Applies to new origination across retail, SME, and CRE. Existing exposure is managed under a separate wind-down playbook (not in this corpus).

## 3. Thresholds

Prohibited for new origination:

- {{ facts.prohibited_cluster_munitions }}
- {{ facts.prohibited_adult_entertainment }}
- {{ facts.prohibited_illegal_gambling }}
- {{ facts.prohibited_cryptocurrency_mining }}

Restricted (ESG sign-off required):

- thermal coal {{ facts.restricted_thermal_coal }}
- {{ facts.restricted_arctic_oil }}

Sanctions screening uses Sanctions Watchlist version {{ facts.sanctions_watchlist_version }}.

## 4. Authority

ESG sign-off for restricted sectors follows Climate and ESG Overlay (CP-ESG-2026-01).

## 5. Related policies

See Climate and ESG Overlay (CP-ESG-2026-01).
